second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the engine size of the V-Strom?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 156, \"text\": \"Suzuki V-Strom 1000 The Suzuki V-Strom 1000, also known as the DL1000, is a dual-sport motorcycle with a 996 cc V-twin engine and a standard riding posture.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d00\", \"start\": 157, \"end\": 252, \"text\": \"It has been manufactured in Japan by Suzuki since 2002, although sales in Europe ended in 2009.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d00\", \"start\": 253, \"end\": 377, \"text\": \"The name V-Strom combines \\\"V\\\" referring to the bike's engine configuration with the German \\\"Strom\\\", meaning stream or power.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d00\", \"start\": 378, \"end\": 497, \"text\": \"The V-Strom motorcycle is based on the V-twin engine initially designed for the Suzuki TL1000S and TL1000R motorcycles.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d00\", \"start\": 498, \"end\": 611, \"text\": \"It incorporates design elements from other Suzuki motorcycles including fuel injection based on the GSX-R models.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d00\", \"start\": 612, \"end\": 638, \"text\": \"A smaller-engined version,\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 90, \"text\": \"Heated grips with handguards ; fantastic engine bars from Heed that are really well made .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d01\", \"start\": 91, \"end\": 106, \"text\": \"Cornering abs .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d01\", \"start\": 107, \"end\": 260, \"text\": \"Buying experience : Bought the demonstrator with a few hundred miles on it from CJ Ball in Norwich who were excellent and did a deal I could not resist .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d01\", \"start\": 261, \"end\": 366, \"text\": \"Included full metal adventure luggage , the Suzuki integrated heated grips and even a surprise free mug .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d01\", \"start\": 367, \"end\": 533, \"text\": \"4 out of 5 Vstrom1000 more than I expected 08 January 2022 by Paulkwakzx12 Year : 2019 Annual servicing cost : £250 So much better than I had expected bought new at a\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0084-be9811c45994:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"V-Strom\", \"scope\": \"Suzuki V-Strom 1000\", \"claim\": \"The engine size of the Suzuki V-Strom 1000 is 996 cc.\", \"answer\": \"996 cc\", \"quote\": \"Suzuki V-Strom 1000 The Suzuki V-Strom 1000, also known as the DL1000, is a dual-sport motorcycle with a 996 cc V-twin engine and a standard riding posture.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"996 cc\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"996 cc\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
